Iran administrative boundary data
=================================

The generated map paths in this package are derived from OpenStreetMap data.
This includes administrative boundaries, physical coastlines, Iranian islands,
and the Persian Gulf, Gulf of Oman, Caspian Sea, and Strait of Hormuz water polygons.

