Iran capital and administrative-center coordinate data
======================================================

The generated capital marker catalogs are primarily derived from GeoNames
coordinate data distributed by the list-of-cities-in-Iran project. Ambiguous
place-name matches were cross-checked and corrected using OpenStreetMap.

